      "text": "There's rock in London's tap water.",
      "gap": 0.25,
      "caps": [
        "THERE'S *ROCK",
        "IN LONDON'S *WATER"
      ],
      "scene": "hook"
    },
    {
      "text": "Not bits you can see, but rock dissolved into every drop.",
      "gap": 0.3,
      "caps": [
        "NOT BITS",
        "YOU CAN *SEE",
        "BUT ROCK *DISSOLVED",
        "IN EVERY *DROP"
      ],
      "scene": "drop"
    },
    {
      "text": "Here's how it gets there.",
      "gap": 0.25,
      "caps": [
        "HERE'S *HOW"
      ],
      "scene": "zoomout"
    },
    {
      "text": "About two thirds of London's water comes from rivers, and the rest from underground.",
      "gap": 0.2,
      "caps": [
        "TWO *THIRDS",
        "FROM *RIVERS",
        "THE REST FROM",
        "*UNDERGROUND"
      ],
      "scene": "split"
    },
    {
      "text": "On the way, it soaks through chalk and limestone west of the city.",
      "gap": 0.3,
      "caps": [
        "IT SOAKS THROUGH",
        "*CHALK AND LIMESTONE",
        "WEST OF THE *CITY"
      ],
      "scene": "chalkmap"
    },
    {
      "text": "That rock is calcium and magnesium,",
      "gap": 0.12,
      "caps": [
        "*CALCIUM",
        "AND *MAGNESIUM"
      ],
      "scene": "particles"
    },
    {
      "text": "which is why Thames Water says all the water in its region is hard.",
      "gap": 0.3,
      "caps": [
        "THAMES WATER *SAYS",
        "*ALL OF IT",
        "IS *HARD"
      ],
      "scene": "official"
    },
    {
      "text": "Boil it, and those minerals come back out as limescale,",
      "gap": 0.1,
      "caps": [
        "*BOIL IT",
        "THE MINERALS",
        "COME BACK AS",
        "*LIMESCALE"
      ],
      "scene": "kettle"
    },
    {
      "text": "that white crust in your kettle.",
      "gap": 0.3,
      "caps": [
        "THAT WHITE *CRUST"
      ],
      "scene": "kettle2"
    },
    {
      "text": "The good news? Thames Water says it's not harmful.",
      "gap": 0.3,
      "caps": [
        "THE GOOD *NEWS?",
        "THAMES WATER *SAYS",
        "IT'S NOT *HARMFUL"
      ],
      "scene": "safe"
    },
    {
      "text": "Is your water hard? Comment your town.",
      "gap": 0.2,
      "caps": [
        "IS YOUR WATER *HARD?",
        "COMMENT YOUR *TOWN"
      ],
      "scene": "cta"
    }
